# Plan And Progress Artifact Contract

Use explicit runtime artifacts instead of keeping planning and execution memory only in chat.

## Plan artifact

Marker:

```markdown
<!-- AI_SIMPLE_PLAN:START -->
# PLAN::ISSUE-ID
...
<!-- AI_SIMPLE_PLAN:END -->
```

Body template:

- `.ai/reference/plan-template.md`

## Progress artifact

Marker:

```markdown
<!-- AI_SIMPLE_PROGRESS:START -->
# PROGRESS::ISSUE-ID
...
<!-- AI_SIMPLE_PROGRESS:END -->
```

Minimal structure:

```markdown
<!-- AI_SIMPLE_PROGRESS:START -->
# PROGRESS::ISSUE-ID

## Выполнено
- [x] Step 1: ...
- [x] Step 2: ...

## Текущий шаг
**Step N: ...**
- [ ] subtask 1
- [ ] subtask 2

## Дальше
- Step N+1: ...

## Не нарушить
- invariant 1
- invariant 2

## Fix Loop

Optional; required when verify/review/audit returns actionable failures. Template: `.ai/reference/verify-fix-loop.md`.

## Spec Conformance
- Closed:
  - requirement X -> code/tests/evidence
- Open:
  - requirement Y -> planned step
- Drift:
  - `None.` or exact mismatch and corrective action

{% if minimalism_enabled and minimalism_level != "off" -%}
## Minimal Solution Conformance
- Ladder rung per requirement vs actual implementation
- `ponytail:` comments added (file:line) or N/A with reason
- Accepted debt (ceiling + upgrade path) or `None.`
{% endif -%}

## Project Rules Compliance
- [ ] rule from `.ai/rules/project-profile.mdc` → `## Project-Specific Rules` — evidence: pending
- [x] manifesto / workflow-gate constraint — evidence: file:line or test name
- N/A rules must include an explicit reason; open violations block review handoff

## Решения по ходу
- YYYY-MM-DD: decision / reason

## Risks / Notes
- ...
<!-- AI_SIMPLE_PROGRESS:END -->
```

## Local filesystem layout

- Root: `artifacts.planProgressRoot` in `ai.config.yaml` (default `.ai/context/runtime`).
- Per issue: `{{ plan_progress_runtime_root }}/ISSUE-ID/plan.md` and `{{ plan_progress_runtime_root }}/ISSUE-ID/progress.md`.
- Same marker blocks and sections as tracker-backed artifacts; do not place these under `docs/ai/`.

## Update protocol

- `/plan` creates or updates `{{ plan_progress_runtime_root }}/ISSUE-ID/plan.md` (local `PLAN::ISSUE-ID` artifact).
- `/implement` creates or updates `{{ plan_progress_runtime_root }}/ISSUE-ID/progress.md` (local `PROGRESS::ISSUE-ID` artifact).
- When a tracker is enabled, advance issue **workflow state** via MCP; never duplicate plan/progress body into tracker comments.
- Orchestrator-ready plans must also include `## Claimed Write Scope`.
- If `.ai/runtime/orchestrator-state.mjs` manages the issue, progress updates must stay aligned with orchestrator run state.
- Progress must be updated at every step transition, not only at the end.
- `Do Not Break` invariants come from the plan, not from improvisation during coding.
- If review returns `high` or `medium` findings, update progress immediately and move the active step back into the implement/test/verify/review loop.
